  "readme": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n<img width=\"2171\" height=\"1220\" alt=\"1001172629\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8b0cb7a3-9b20-4f38-a43a-fe5743657c5f\" />\n\n\n# HyperOS AOD Mod\n\n**The HyperOS Always-on Display and Lock Screen Editor with every feature unlocked on all devices.**\n\n[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Mods-Center/HyperOS-AOD?style=for-the-badge&label=release&color=0a84ff)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-AOD/releases/latest)\n[![Downloads](https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Mods-Center/HyperOS-AOD/total?style=for-the-badge&color=30d158)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-AOD/releases)\n[![Stars](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Mods-Center/HyperOS-AOD?style=for-the-badge&color=ffd60a)](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-AOD/stargazers)\n[![Telegram](https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-channel-26A5E4?style=for-the-badge&logo=telegram&logoColor=white)](https://t.me/kashis_cringey_stuffs)\n\n</div>\n\n## Requirements\n- HyperOS 4\n- Magisk, KernelSU or APatch\n\n## Installation\n1. Download the latest zip from [**Releases**](https://github.com/Mods-Center/HyperOS-AOD/releases/latest).\n2. Flash it in Magisk, KernelSU or APatch.\n3. The module installs in 2 steps to avoid resolution errors. Follow the prompts.\n4. Reboot your device.\n\n## Screenshots\n<p align=\"center\">\n<img width=\"1184\" height=\"2547\" alt=\"1001172626\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/91d6791f-448a-4cb1-8935-884a03f6197b\" />\n<img width=\"1184\" height=\"2547\" alt=\"1001172625\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ca1b36b0-0158-472e-8f49-48b9c3047ccc\" />\n<img width=\"1184\" height=\"2547\" alt=\"1001172627\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dec61fc3-1cde-4120-9b9f-2f50bc963bbd\" />\n<img width=\"1184\" height=\"2547\" alt=\"1001172623\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fff12245-172e-4f88-80f4-d7ddfa4401e3\" />\n<img width=\"1184\" height=\"25